odo>(stores.todos, 1)\n  if (todo) {\n    console.log('Found todo:', todo)\n  }\n})","lang":"typescript"}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"t","text":"T","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"objectstore","text":"objectStore","level":3},{"id":"key","text":"key","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction getByKey<T>(objectStore, key): Promise<T | undefined>;\n```\n\nDefined in: packages/db/src/indexed-db-wrapper.ts:391\n\nRetrieves a single item by its key from an object store.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### T\n\n`T`\n\nThe type of the item\n\n## Parameters\n\n### objectStore\n\n`IDBObjectStore`\n\nThe IDBObjectStore to read from\n\n### key\n\n`IDBValidKey`\n\nThe key of the item to retrieve\n\n## Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<`T` \\| `undefined`\\>\n\nA promise that resolves to the item, or undefined if not found\n\n## Example\n\n```typescript\nawait executeTransaction(db, 'todos', 'readonly', async (tx, stores) => {\n  const todo = await getByKey<Todo>(stores.todos, 1)\n  if (todo) {\n    console.log('Found todo:', todo)\n  }\n})\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: getByKey\ntitle: getByKey\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction getByKey<T>(objectStore, key): Promise<T | undefined>;\n```\n\nDefined in: packages/db/src/indexed-db-wrapper.ts:391\n\nRetrieves a single item by its key from an object store.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### T\n\n`T`\n\nThe type of the item\n\n## Parameters\n\n### objectStore\n\n`IDBObjectStore`\n\nThe IDBObjectStore to read from\n\n### key\n\n`IDBValidKey`\n\nThe key of the item to retrieve\n\n## Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<`T` \\| `undefined`\\>\n\nA promise that resolves to the item, or undefined if not found\n\n## Example\n\n```typescript\nawait executeTransaction(db, 'todos', 'readonly', async (tx, stores) => {\n  const todo = await getByKey<Todo>(stores.todos, 1)\n  if (todo) {\n    console.log('Found todo:', todo)\n  }\n})\n```\n"}
